      "content": "got it. one more thing then—i've heard stories about starters just \"dying\" or acting totally weird for no reason even if you feed them. is there some kind of invisible factor that can mess up the balance between the yeast and the bacteria? like something that just happens under the surface that you can't really see or control?",
